## Supabase
## Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values from your Supabase
## project (Project Settings -> API). Uses the same Supabase project as the
## q-game web app, so the mobile app reads/writes the same data.
##
## EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is required for Expo to expose a var to client code.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
